flowchart TD
    VM["ViewModel"] --> REPO["Repository (cache policy owner)"]
    REPO -.->|write/mutation| INV["invalidate/update cache"]
    REPO --> LRU{in-memory LRU hit and fresh?}
    LRU -->|yes| HOT["return (hot)"]
    LRU -->|no| ROOM{Room hit and fresh?}
    ROOM -->|yes| RET["return + populate memory"]
    ROOM -->|stale/miss| SF["single-flight fetch (Ch 11)"]
    SF --> OK["OkHttp (HTTP cache: ETag/304)"]
    OK --> BK["Backend"]
    BK --> WR["write Room + memory, set updatedAt/etag"]
    WR --> RET
